{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104751","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104751/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104751/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104751/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104751","id":2957513675,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6wSBPL","number":104751,"title":"Enabling shadows on labels with lots of characters degrades performance","user":{"login":"Chaosed0","id":2808430,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDg0MzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2808430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosed0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-03-28T23:40:21Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T22:52:23Z","closed_at":"2025-03-30T22:30:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.3 and 4.4.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6070) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10750H CPU @ 2.60GHz (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen rendering text under the Vulkan driver in 4.3, nothing is batched. Text is rendered character-by-character, one draw call at a time. Even worse, with shadows and outlines on, characters each receive multiple draw calls.\n\nThe state of things has improved in 4.4 with this PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92797\n\nHowever, text with shadows enabled in 4.4 still does not batch. It appears that stuartcarnie attempted to resolve the situation with this PR, but closed it because it degrades performance in other scenarios: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97340\n\nGiven that the situation remains unresolved, I'm opening this issue to track the problem, as it is an issue for our game with lots of text.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a project with a label with a large amount of characters. Observe that performance is fine, around 2ms per frame.\n\nEnable shadows on the label. Observe large performance degredation (30ms per frame on my machine).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP_text_batching.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19513960/MRP_text_batching.zip)\n\nNote that this is passivestar's MRP from here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92797#issuecomment-2309051165","closed_by":{"login":"Chaosed0","id":2808430,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDg0MzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2808430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosed0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104751/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104751/t